    "description": "Developed project using Visual Studio ,C#.Net and ASP.Net.\nInvolved in the full life cycle of the project as a full stack developer from requirements gathering, analyzing, designing UI/middle tier/database and transition.\nCreated Use Case, Activity, State Chart, Sequence and Collaboration Diagrams using Visio thus defining the Data Process Model and Business Process Model.\nDesigned UI in ASP.Net using .Net Controls, AJAX, JavaScript, HTML and Common Controls.  \nCreated Custom Controls for product customization and user interface using Visual Studio.\nDesigned Relational Databases, Stored Procedure, Triggers and Reporting Services integrated with LINQ.\nImplemented key technologies like Web Parts, Page Methods, Ajax, Modal Dialogs, Master pages to enhance usability & functionality by reducing page refresh & load time.\nDesigned and developed functions of Inventory Management System like track shipments, Inventory lookup, work requests and trouble tickets.\nUsed Microsoft Report Viewer to generate daily inventory reports, daily shipments.\nDeveloped and used WCF services to get data from Smart Turn to integrate information in Portal.\nDesigned a single sign on service solution to authenticate and authorize Smart Turn Users through Portal.\nUsed QuickBooks SDK services to get data from QuickBooks to integrate information in QB APP.\nInvolved in tuning application queries running on relational database management.\nExtensively used ADO.Net to access database objects tables and Stored Procedure.\nUsed QuickBooks SDK services to create PO & SO into the QuickBooks ERP system through the application.\nWritten and Executes Integration Test Cases and System Test Plan for various modules of the application.\nTroubleshooting and bug fixes.\nCreated document center application.\nCreated Ad Scheduling application through MVC.\nCreated Selfie application.\nCreated e-commerce websites through WordPress.",
